# pop'n music 12 Iroha: test mode > NETWORK OPTIONS (item 8) > e-AMUSEMENT OPTIONS (no ee'MALL line) >
# e-AMUSEMENT ON, SAVE AND EXIT. Then power cycle; run oracle/scripts/popn12-card-new.his with the same --nvram.
#   hiraku-popn12 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn12-eamuse-on.his
game popn12
at 3000 press "Test" 10
at 3300 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3320 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3340 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3360 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3380 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3400 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3420 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3440 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3520 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 3620 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 3760 hold "P1 Button 5"
at 3780 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3810 release "P1 Button 5"
at 3860 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3880 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3900 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3920 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3960 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 4130 quit
